  "body": "On the market for the first time in nearly 60 years, this sunny and level 911sqm (more or less) property presents a wealth of possibilities in one of Bucklands Beach's most sought-after locations. Whether you're looking to renovate and add value, create your dream family home or invest for the future, this is an opportunity not to be missed. \r\n\r\nConveniently positioned close to Lloyd Elsmore Park, Pakuranga College, and the amenities of Highland Park Shopping Centre, the location offers both lifestyle appeal and long-term potential.\r\n\r\nThis property comprises:\r\n\r\n• In zone for Macleans Primary School, Bucklands Beach Intermediate, and Pakuranga College\r\n• Excellent public transport options nearby, with easy access to main routes along Pakuranga Highway\r\n• Surrounded by popular cafés, restaurants, and the Half Moon Bay Marina, which offers ferry services to Auckland’s CBD and Waiheke Island\r\n\r\nCall Lawrence and Wendy for a private appointment.",
